OL,3,ADaisy Edgar-Jones: I try and bury my
OL,4,Aemotion when it comes to love
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaisy Edgar-Jones has been well cast in
OL,7,Fher new film.
OL,9,FShe plays Elinor, the rational elder
OL,10,Fsister in Sense and Sensibility,
OL,11,Fopposite the younger, more romantic
OL,12,Fsister Marianne.
OL,14,FSpeaking to the BBC, Edgar-Jones says
OL,15,Fthat in her personal life, she really
OL,16,Fis like her character.
OL,18,F"When it comes to love, I think I am
OL,19,Fvery much more Elinor in every sort of
OL,20,Fway," she says.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/17
